gan County","/arc-plc/michigan/cheboygan-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids ran 221% of normal in February to March and 69% of normal in September to October. Grid 30483 had its driest year in 1955 at 70% of normal.</p>"}
